sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant Host as macOS host
  participant Work as kanna3-workd
  participant Mux as kanna3d
  participant Agent as The agent
  Person->>Host: ask agent on a line, optional note
  Host->>Work: work.agent.ask
  Work->>Work: anchored thread + task event + queue
  Work->>Mux: deliver to doc target
  loop until idle and no draft
    Mux-->>Work: held: draft / busy / waiting / unknown
    Work-->>Host: Comments delivery chip
  end
  Mux->>Agent: bracketed paste, then Enter
  Agent->>Work: edit spec.md, kanna doc reply and resolve
  Work-->>Host: changed spec and agent replied
